    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Known finding",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "`/tpa/health` (Lattice) has reported `\"database\": false` locally since 2026-09-24 while answering 200. The overview shows the network stack as **degraded** for that reason, not as an outage. The ask to answer 503 is docs/REQUESTS.md \u00a71.\n\nLogs from this host process are not shipped yet. docs/SPEC.md W2: host-process logs stay out until each is shown clean (their JSON formatters put the full traceback and every extra field on the line). See docs/REQUESTS.md \u00a73.",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "id": 6
